## Summary

A configuration change lowered the Billing API's database connection pool from 200 connections to 20. Under normal load, requests queued waiting for a connection and timed out, driving the error rate to a peak of 38.5%. The change was rolled back and errors returned to baseline 47 minutes after deployment.

